     },
     "value": "The Registration Board considers drug registration applications made under Rule 26 of the Drugs (Licensing, Registering and Advertising) Rules 1976, after DRAP's evaluation division prepares a summary; local sites may be inspected and foreign sites undergo GMP inspection before registration."
